    <li><a href="https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/images-vision">OpenAI images and vision guide</a>, including the patch worked examples</li>
    <li><a href="https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/vision">Anthropic vision guide</a> and its published dimension table</li>
    <li><a href="https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/media-resolution">Gemini media resolution reference</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/tokens">Gemini token guide</a>, for the 2.x tile rule</li>
  </ul></div>
</KnowledgeLayout>
